      "arm": "virtual-nested-capability-backend",
      "mode": "m2",
      "key": "dir",
      "vehicle": "capstone-virtual",
      "because": "mode 2 is the arm in which the pool's own lease return revokes: modes 0 and 1 are the same adapter with no revoke and with a block-granular one, and the bundle carries all three."
